        <target state="translated">ComboBox 控件本身。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticSuffixDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Suffix area hosting user suffix content, form feedback and the drop-down handle.</source>
        <target state="translated">後綴區域，承載使用者後綴內容、表單回饋與下拉指示器。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="StatusDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Add status to Input with status, which could be error or warning.</source>
        <target state="translated">通過 status 為輸入框添加錯誤或警告狀態。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="StatusTitle">
      <segment>
