        <target state="translated">狀態</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="StyleClassDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Customize the semantic structure style of ComboBox with semantic part styles, including the input frame border color.</source>
        <target state="translated">使用語意部件樣式自訂 ComboBox 的語意結構樣式，包括輸入框邊框顏色。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="StyleClassTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Custom Semantic Part styling</source>
        <target state="translated">自訂語義結構的樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ThreeSizesDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>ComboBox supports large (40px), default (32px), small (24px), and Custom sizes with local size properties.</source>
        <target state="translated">ComboBox 支持大號（40px）、默認（32px）、小號（24px），也支持通過 Custom 配合本地尺寸屬性自定義。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
